==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[óska]]'' meaning "to [[wish]]" + ''[[til hamingju]]'' meaning "[[congratulations]]".

===Verb===
'''[[óska]] [[til hamingju]]'''

# to [[congratulate]]
#: ''Átti hann ekki eftir að '''óska''' þér '''til hamingju'''?''
#:: He's yet to '''congratulate''' you isn't he?

